  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A$ be a matrix of order $3 \\times 3$ and $|A|=5$. If $|2 \\operatorname{adj}(3 \\mathrm{~A} \\operatorname{adj}(2 \\mathrm{~A}))|=2^\\alpha \\cdot 3^\\beta \\cdot 5^\\gamma \\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma \\in \\mathrm{N}$ then $\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma$ is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
